      },
      "message": "Add the bf CLI skeleton: every verb, stub modules, real doctor\n\nWires the full command surface from the plan (agents, board, claim,\nheartbeat, release, note, stop, prs, run, doctor, serve, web) with\nexit codes 0/1/2/3/64, adds stub modules with their final signatures\n(agents, board, identity, prs, tui with the Source trait and Snapshot\nrows) so PRs 4-6 compile independently, and makes `bf doctor`\nlock-free (no hub, no database) so it works while `bf serve` runs.\nWriter identity (identity.rs) is real: --as/BF_AGENT plus the observed\nprovider and pid from the /proc ancestor chain, with tests. Adds\nratatui/crossterm pins, clap `env`, and AGENTS.md with the board rules.\n\nPlan of record PR 3: ~/.claude/plans/please-study-the-tips-snazzy-canyon.md\nBuilt on top of the PR 2b prune (grok, #3).\n\nbf-author: claude/claude-orch\nbf-claim: AGENT_CHAT.md 2026-09-18T16:11Z\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
